'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page two of the [[Truth Enforcers Premium Warbond#Page 2|Truth Enforcers]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|45|notext}} and 35 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

